/* ---- Sidebar via CSS scroll markers ----
   Chrome opens .mhtml files sandboxed: #links, scripts and form controls a=
re all disabled there.
   Scroll markers are handled by the browser itself, so they still work. Fa=
llback: the <nav> links. */
h2,h3{scroll-margin-top:18px}
