ure>
<ol class=3D"nl"><li><span class=3D"n">1</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><stro=
ng>Gateway:</strong> authenticates, checks the device, rate-limits, require=
s <code>Idempotency-Key</code>.</p></div></li><li><span class=3D"n">2</span=
><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Transfer Service:</strong> validates the re=
quest (amount &gt; 0, not the same wallet, step-up done for large amounts),=
 looks up both shards. Same shard =E2=86=92 local path.</p></div></li><li><=
span class=3D"n">3</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>One transaction on =
shard 3:</strong> the SQL below. Locks are taken in <code>wallet_id</code> =
order so two opposite transfers can't deadlock (Deep Dive 3).</p></div></li=
><li><span class=3D"n">4</span><div class=3D"li-b"><p><strong>Commit</stron=
g> =E2=86=92 the outbox row is published to Kafka =E2=86=92 notifications a=
nd history update within a second.</p></div></li></ol>
<div class=3D"code"><div class=3D"code-bar"><span class=3D"dots"><i></i><i>=
</i><i></i></span><span class=3D"lang">SQL</span></div><pre><code class=3D"=
hljs"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">START</span> TRANSACTION;
<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 1. dedup: a retry with the same key fails h=
ere with a duplicate-key error (Deep Dive 5)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> idempotency_keys (scope_id, idem_key, request_hash, txn_id) <span =
class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (:asha, :key, :hash, :txn);
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> transactions (txn_id, type, status, from_wallet_id, to_wallet_id, =
amount_minor)
     <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span> (:txn, <span class=3D"hljs-=
string">&#x27;TRANSFER&#x27;</span>, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;COMP=
LETED&#x27;</span>, :asha, :ravi, <span class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>)=
;

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 2. lock both wallets in id order (deadlock-=
free), then check-and-debit atomically</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">SELECT</span> wallet_id <span class=3D"hljs-ke=
yword">FROM</span> wallets <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> wallet=
_id <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">IN</span> (:asha, :ravi) <span class=3D"hl=
js-keyword">ORDER</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">BY</span> wallet_id <=
span class=3D"hljs-keyword">FOR</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE<=
/span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> wallets <span class=3D"hljs-keyw=
ord">SET</span> balance_minor <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> bala=
nce_minor <span class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number=
">50000</span>, version <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> version <s=
pan class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>
 <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> wallet_id <span class=3D"hljs-op=
erator">=3D</span> :asha <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AND</span> status <sp=
an class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;ACT=
IVE&#x27;</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AND</span> balance_minor <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-operator">-</span> held_minor <span class=3D"hljs-operator"=
>&gt;=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>;
<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 0 rows affected =E2=86=92 ROLLBACK, return =
INSUFFICIENT_FUNDS (or WALLET_FROZEN)</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">UPDATE</span> wallets <span class=3D"hljs-keyw=
ord">SET</span> balance_minor <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> bala=
nce_minor <span class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number=
">50000</span>, version <span class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> version <s=
pan class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">1</span>
 <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">WHERE</span> wallet_id <span class=3D"hljs-op=
erator">=3D</span> :ravi <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AND</span> status <sp=
an class=3D"hljs-operator">=3D</span> <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;ACT=
IVE&#x27;</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">AND</span> balance_minor <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-operator">+</span> <span class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>=
 <span class=3D"hljs-operator">&lt;=3D</span> :ravi_cap;
<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 0 rows affected =E2=86=92 ROLLBACK, return =
LIMIT_EXCEEDED (or WALLET_FROZEN)</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 3. the ledger: one debit + one credit, equa=
l amounts</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> ledger_entries (txn_id, wallet_id, direction, amount_minor, balanc=
e_after_minor) <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">VALUES</span>
  (:txn, :asha, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;DEBIT&#x27;</span>,  <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>, :asha_after),
  (:txn, :ravi, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;CREDIT&#x27;</span>, <spa=
n class=3D"hljs-number">50000</span>, :ravi_after);

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">-- 4. event for notifications / history / risk=
, published after commit by the relay</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INSERT</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">INT=
O</span> outbox (aggregate_id, type, payload) <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">=
VALUES</span> (:asha, <span class=3D"hljs-string">&#x27;TRANSFER_COMPLETED&=
#x27;</span>, :json);
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">COMMIT</span>;</code></pre></div>
<div class=3D"callout tip"><div class=3D"ct">Why this is safe</div><p>The b=
alance check is <em>inside</em> the <code>UPDATE =E2=80=A6 WHERE balance - =
held &gt;=3D amount</code>, which runs on the latest committed row under an=
 exclusive row lock. Two concurrent debits can't both pass it (Deep Dive 2)=
. The <code>CHECK</code> constraint is a second safety net.</p></div>
