/td><td><code>UPDATE =E2=80=A6 WHERE status =3D 'PENDING'</code> changes 1 =
row the first time and 0 afterwards</td></tr><tr><td>Webhook says "success"=
 but it's forged</td><td>verify the HMAC signature and re-fetch the payment=
 from the gateway API; check amount and currency match our row</td></tr><tr=
><td>Payment succeeded <strong>after</strong> we marked the top-up FAILED (=
expired)</td><td>still credit it (the user paid) or auto-refund through the=
 gateway; never silently keep the money. Reconciliation catches any we miss=
ed</td></tr><tr><td>Credit would break the KYC cap</td><td>refund the payme=
nt to its source via the gateway and tell the user</td></tr><tr><td>Chargeb=
ack weeks later</td><td>a new <code>REVERSAL</code> transaction debits the =
wallet (may go to a negative recovery account if already spent; risk team f=
ollows up)</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<div class=3D"callout interview"><div class=3D"ct">=F0=9F=92=AC Interview l=
ine</div><p>"We never credit on the client's word or the webhook body alone=
: a pending row exists first, the gateway's status API confirms, and a cond=
itional PENDING =E2=86=92 COMPLETED transition makes webhooks, retries and =
the poller safe to run together."</p></div>
